# Allowlist: only the Go sources this Dockerfile and tools/recorder/Dockerfile
# build from enter the context, never a local binary (cmd/dispatcher/dispatcher
# after a go build there), an .env or editor files. Files a package embeds
# will need a line of their own.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/**/*.go
!internal/**/*.go
!tools/**/*.go
**/*_test.go
**/testdata
